OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with some heavy showers moving
OL,7,Faway to the east initially and clear
OL,8,Fspells developing for a time. Clouding
OL,9,Fover through the night with further
OL,10,Fpatchy light rain developing. Fresh to
OL,11,Fstrong, gusty winds, particularly
OL,12,Faround the coast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FGenerally cloudy with
OL,15,Fpatchy rain across the region. Rain
OL,16,Fmostly light but turning heavy and
OL,17,Fmore persistent overnight. Winds
OL,18,Fslowly easing. Temperatures above
OL,19,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
