OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FCloudy with occasional rain through
OL,7,FThursday. Largely dry Friday and
OL,8,FSaturday but a chance of coastal
OL,9,Fshowers. Temperatures below normal.
OL,10,FMostly light winds but strengthening
OL,11,Flater.
